QUERY: Generate a random SS316L microstructure and convert it to PRISMS-Plasticity input. Then calibrate the slip parameters to match the experimental tensile curve (SS316L_experiment.txt). Tune: Initial Slip Resistance [100-150 MPa], Initial Hardening Modulus [800-2500 MPa], Saturation Stress [350-600 MPa], Power Law Exponent [1-3]. Stop when RMSE < 5 MPa or MAPE < 2% or after 60 simulations.
